    '''
    cbrt(arg, /)
    Evaluate the cube root of the provided input.

    Args:
        arg (float | drjit.ArrayBase): A Python or Dr.Jit floating point type

    Returns:
        float | drjit.ArrayBase: Cube root of the input
    '''
